            "review_text": "Willszsz\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nA Mediterranean gem on middle of Pham Viet Chanh\nJul 2025 • Friends\nA little Gem on middle of Pham Viet Chanh!\nGreat mezze, super well done Mediterranean dishes.\nThanks to chef Louis, amazing Côté a l'os.\nWe discovered Ô the art space on top odmf the restaurant, have many exhibitions, well surpise.\nGive it a try!\nWritten July 25, 2025\nOliuu Creative Bistro\nThank you Willszsz! 🌟\nWe're so glad you discovered our little Mediterranean gem in Pham Viet Chanh — and even more delighted that you explored Ô, our hidden art space upstairs! 🎨\n\nBig cheers from Chef Louis and the whole team for your kind words on the côte à l’os and mezze 🫒\nWe can’t wait to welcome you back for more culinary and artistic surprises.\n\n— Ôliuu, where food meets art 🍷✨\nRead more\nWritten August 6, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
