            "review_text": "Samson L\nCannes, France\n0\nAmazing culinary experience\nJul 2025 • Friends\nThis was one of the best culinary experience I had in Vietnam, the sense of mediterranean cuisine with a touch a creativity! Thanks for tonight !\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 24, 2025\nOliuu Creative Bistro\nThank you so much, Samson! 🇫🇷✨\nWe’re honored to be part of your best culinary memories in Vietnam. Mediterranean flavors with a creative twist — that’s exactly what we strive for at Ôliuu!\n\nMerci encore and see you next time for more mezze, wine, and good vibes 🫒🍷\n— The Ôliuu Team, Creative Bistro in Pham Viet Chanh\nRead more\nWritten August 6, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
