            "review_text": "Bourcier J\n0\nSuperbe !\nMay 2025 • Solo\nWhat a surprise !\nVery cozy restaurant, with dedicated staff and kitchen. \nAll the products are fresh and carefully prepared in the open kitchen.\nSpecial mention to the hummus, millefeuille potatoes and chicken.\nFeel like in the middle of the Mediterranean coast.\nRead more\nWritten May 27, 2025\nOliuu Creative Bistro\nThank you so much for your kind words!\nWe’re truly delighted that your experience at Ôliuu felt like a journey to the Mediterranean coast 🌊\nOur team takes great pride in crafting each dish with care and creativity, and we're thrilled the hummus, millefeuille potatoes, and chicken stood out for you.\nWe hope to welcome you back soon for more delightful moments around our open kitchen!\n\nWarm regards,\nThe Ôliuu Team ✨\nRead more\nWritten June 1, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
